WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.340
A September evening,
not yet seven o'clock,

2
00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:08.450
and "a dense drizzly fog lay
low upon the great city".

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.060
On the Strand, the lamps
shrink to blurred circles.

4
00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:16.210
Faces drift through the light
from shop windows, then vanish.

5
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:19.460
A four-wheeled cab pulls
away into the murk.

6
00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:23.670
Again and again, Doyle's
London disappears into fog.

7
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.520
Why does he keep doing that?

8
00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:28.560
In this mission, you'll ride
with Watson down the Strand,

9
00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:30.800
and zoom in on the words he chooses.

10
00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:35.930
You'll see new suburbs reach out like "the
monster tentacles which the giant city

11
00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:38.110
was throwing out into the country".

12
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.620
And you'll follow a night
chase down the Thames,

13
00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:42.200
out to the marshes.

14
00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:46.760
Your mission: explain why Doyle's
London keeps vanishing into fog.
